    "description": "Storehouse, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 432 blocks vs 270 (first build 361 vs 230). Half-timbered barn (plaster in a dark oak frame on a cobblestone course, spruce gable roof) with double oak doors; chests and barrels along the walls and a desk inside; L2 adds the lectern ledger, the hoist beam with a barrel on its chain, the side awning with crates, shelves and door lanterns; L3 hay and crates out front, sign, banners, planters, bushes. Not yet builder-tested: dandelion, lectern, red_wall_banner. Decoration step adds: hand_cart, item, sign_text.",
